'''Baron Seal Strikes''' (ヒュージゴマ強襲) is an event added in [[Version 10.7 Update|Version 10.7]] and released in [[Version 10.8 Update|Version 10.8]]. Like all [[Gauntlet]]s, progress made in Baron Seal Strikes will reset when the event ends, allowing the player to collect the rewards again once the event returns. The boss of this Gauntlet is [[Baron Seal]], a longer-ranged variant of [[Sir Seal]] with [[Freeze|freeze]] and [[Weaken]] abilities.

==Overview==
===About===
Baron Seal Strikes contains a total of 20 [[No Continues]] levels, called '''Red Alerts'''. After beating a Red Alert, the player must wait for 30 minutes before they may proceed to the next one. Rewards for the first completion of a Red Alert can include XP, [[Cat Capsule|Tickets]], [[Gamatoto Expedition|Catamins]] and [[Ototo Corps|Materials]]. Every 20 Red Alerts play out the same, but the strength magnifications and enemy base's HP are increased with each level.

===Stage Battlegrounds===
:''See [[Baron Seal Strikes/Red Alert 1~20]].''

==Play Requirements==
*Baron Seal Strikes! is unlocked after clearing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 3.

